---
import MinimalAdLayout from '../../../layouts/MinimalAdLayout.astro';
import LocalClaimService from '../../../components/LocalClaimService.astro';
import ReviewFAQ from '../../../components/ReviewFAQ.astro';
import { deniedPropertyFaq } from '../../../data/market-review';
---

<MinimalAdLayout
  title="Denied Property Insurance Claim in North Carolina | Claim Guardians"
  description="Help reviewing a denied homeowners or commercial property insurance claim in North Carolina. Understand the written decision and request a free initial review."
  accentColor="#b91c1c"
  ctaLabel="Free Property Claim Review"
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({ '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'FAQPage', mainEntity: deniedPropertyFaq.map(item => ({ '@type': 'Question', name: item.q, acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: item.a } })) })} />
  </Fragment>

  <!-- 1. HERO -->
  <section class="relative bg-[#041224] overflow-hidden" style="padding-top:8rem; padding-bottom:8rem;">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img src="/images/florida-damaged-house-hero.png" alt="Property damage illustration for a North Carolina claim review" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-50 scale-105" fetchpriority="high" />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#041224]/95 via-[#3b0a0a]/85 via-60% to-[#041224]/90"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="section-inner relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-red-300 mb-4">
          <span class="relative flex h-2.5 w-2.5">
            <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-red-400 opacity-75"></span>
            <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2.5 w-2.5 bg-red-400"></span>
          </span>
          North Carolina - Property Claim Review
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6 tracking-tight leading-[1.1]">
          Denied property insurance claim in North Carolina?
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-medium mb-10 max-w-3xl">
          Get help understanding a homeowners or commercial property claim denial, comparing the insurer’s explanation with your evidence, and deciding what to do next. Claim Guardians offers public adjusting services for property losses.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 mb-10">
          <a href="#claim-form" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 text-base font-extrabold text-white bg-red-700 hover:bg-red-800 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all">Request a free property claim review</a>
          <a href="tel:3058045489" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 text-base font-extrabold text-white border-2 border-white/30 bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 rounded-xl transition-all">&#128222; Talk to an expert now</a>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>NC individual license linked below</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Free initial review</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>Se habla espanol</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <LocalClaimService city="North Carolina" state="NC" area="North Carolina" denied />

  <section class="section-white"><div class="section-inner max-w-4xl"><h2 class="section-heading mb-5">Start with the written reason for the denial</h2><p class="text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-5">A denial can involve a coverage issue, disputed facts or missing information. Gather the decision and records that address its specific reasoning. Public adjusting representation, regulator assistance and legal representation have different roles.</p><a class="font-bold text-[#006775] underline" href="https://www.ncdoi.gov/assistance-or-file-complaint">NC DOI: consumer assistance and what it can resolve</a></div></section>

  <!-- 3. DENIAL TACTICS -->
  <section class="section-muted">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="color:#b91c1c;">Understand the decision</span>
        <h2 class="section-heading mb-4">Reasons to examine in a property claim denial</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-500 font-medium leading-relaxed mt-4">A useful review addresses the reason given in your decision, the relevant policy wording and the available evidence. Different reasons call for different next steps.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-100 shadow-sm overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-1 bg-red-700"></div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-[#082142] mb-3">"Pre-existing damage"</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 font-medium">Compare the insurer’s findings with dated photographs, maintenance records and available inspection reports. <strong class="text-[#082142]">The cause and timeline need evidence.</strong></p>
        </div>
        <div class="relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-100 shadow-sm overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-1 bg-red-700"></div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-[#082142] mb-3">"Filed too late"</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 font-medium">Keep the loss date, reporting dates and decision letter. <strong class="text-[#082142]">Ask promptly which deadlines apply.</strong> A review does not extend a deadline; consult an attorney for legal advice about your rights.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-100 shadow-sm overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-1 bg-red-700"></div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-[#082142] mb-3">"Not covered"</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 font-medium">Identify the provision cited and compare it with the reported damage. <strong class="text-[#082142]">Coverage depends on the policy and facts.</strong> Further documentation may clarify a dispute but cannot create coverage.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 5. PROCESS FOR APPEALS -->
  <section class="section-muted">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="color:#b91c1c;">The review process</span>
        <h2 class="section-heading">What happens after you request a review</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
        <div class="card-hover p-8">
          <div class="text-5xl font-black text-red-700/10 mb-4 leading-none">01</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-[#082142] mb-3">Free denial review</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 font-medium text-sm">We discuss the property loss and written decision to assess whether our service fits. The initial review is free.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-hover p-8">
          <div class="text-5xl font-black text-red-700/10 mb-4 leading-none">02</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-[#082142] mb-3">Discuss the evidence</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 font-medium text-sm">We identify available photographs, estimates and inspection records, then discuss whether further documentation is needed.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-hover p-8">
          <div class="text-5xl font-black text-red-700/10 mb-4 leading-none">03</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-[#082142] mb-3">Agree on representation</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 font-medium text-sm">Before representation starts, a separate written agreement explains the scope of work, fees, expenses and cancellation terms.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-hover p-8">
          <div class="text-5xl font-black text-red-700/10 mb-4 leading-none">04</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-[#082142] mb-3">Present and discuss the claim</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 font-medium text-sm">Within the agreed scope, we present supporting records and communicate with the insurer. The outcome depends on the policy, evidence and claim circumstances.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 6. PA VS LAWYER -->
  <section class="section-white">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="color:#b91c1c;">PA vs lawyer</span>
        <h2 class="section-heading">Public adjusting, legal advice and regulator assistance</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-500 font-medium max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-4">The right help depends on the problem. A public adjuster documents and negotiates property claims; an attorney provides legal advice and representation. Neither role guarantees an outcome.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border-2 border-[#00B5A6]/30 bg-[#002D51] p-8 text-white">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#00B5A6]/20 text-[#00B5A6]"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span>
            Public adjuster
          </h3>
          <ul class="space-y-4 font-medium">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-[#00B5A6] mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>Documents property damage and the claimed loss.</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-[#00B5A6] mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>Communicates with the insurer within the agreed scope.</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-[#00B5A6] mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>Fees and expenses are explained in a written agreement.</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-[#00B5A6] mt-0.5">&#10003;</span>Does not provide legal representation.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border-2 border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-[#082142] mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-200 text-slate-500"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 2v20M2 12h20"/></svg></span>
            Attorney
          </h3>
          <ul class="space-y-4 text-slate-600 font-medium">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-slate-400 mt-0.5">&#8226;</span>Advises on legal rights and deadlines.</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-slate-400 mt-0.5">&#8226;</span>May handle negotiation or litigation, depending on the matter.</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-slate-400 mt-0.5">&#8226;</span>Explains legal fees and terms separately.</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-slate-400 mt-0.5">&#8226;</span>Assesses legal disputes and available legal remedies.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-center text-slate-500 font-medium mt-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto"><strong class="text-[#082142]">Not sure which you need?</strong> Describe your situation at the initial review. For legal questions, consult an attorney; for consumer assistance, contact the North Carolina Department of Insurance.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <ReviewFAQ faq={deniedPropertyFaq} />

  <!-- 8. FINAL CTA + FORM -->


</MinimalAdLayout>
